sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Dish as Dish
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Dish: updatePortioning(portionSize, portionUnit)
    Note over Dish: Policies: dishRead, dishWrite, dishExecute
    Note over Dish: Guards (2)
    Dish->>Dish: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;active#quot;
    Dish->>Dish: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Dish->>Dish: compute.previousPortionSize
    Dish->>Dish: compute.previousPortionUnit
    Dish->>Dish: mutate.portionSize
    Dish->>Dish: mutate.portionUnit
    Dish->>EventBus: emit DishPortioningUpdated on dish.portioning_updated
    Dish-->>-Client: void